OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft outage disrupts hospital
OL,4,Acommunications
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitals in the West of England have
OL,7,Fexperienced disruption following a
OL,8,Fglobal Microsoft Outlook email outage.
OL,10,FThe outage affected services including
OL,11,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot
OL,12,Facross the world. Microsoft said the
OL,13,Fcause was "elevated load" on its server
OL,14,Finfrastructure.
OL,16,FBy 14:00 GMT, the company said it was
OL,17,Fseeing improvements, "with email queues
OL,18,Fsignificantly reduced and approaching
OL,19,Fnormal levels".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
